 This project uses ONLY Python built-in libraries.
No pip install needed!

 Just run: python gravity_paint.py

 Built-in dependencies (no install required):
- tkinter   (GUI framework — comes with Python)
 - math      (math functions — comes with Python)
 - random    (random numbers — comes with Python)

 Required Python version
python>=3.6

 Optional (for future enhancements):
 Pillow>=10.0.0      # If you want to export screenshots as PNG
 numpy>=1.24.0        # If you want faster physics calculations
..
